摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Manage the Office content your agents create. An open-source, self-hosted workspace where people and AI agents edit, collaborate, and review changes. Built with Univer Office SDK.","id":"gh:1334011664","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"univer-workspace","slug":"dream-num/univer-workspace","topics":["agent-artifacts","board","docx","dsh-plugin","excel","local-first","notion-database","office","pptx","self-hosted","univer","workspace","xlsx"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Manage the Office content your agents create. An open-source, self-hosted workspace where people and"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" AI agents edit, collaborate, and review changes. Built with Univer Office SDK."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Univer Workspace"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**An open-source Office workspace where people and AI agents create, collaborate, and review togethe"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" open-source Office workspace where people and AI agents create, collaborate, and review together.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Univer Docs · Server SDK · CLI guide · Workspace Agent · Issues"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Univer Workspace is a deployable knowledge and collaboration workspace built on the\nUniver Office SD"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"K. It brings Sheets, Docs, Slides,\nrelational tables, canvases, and more into one shared runtime, wi"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"th data and\nreferences staying connected across artifacts as the workspace changes."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Choose the Workspace Browser for direct editing, Workspace Agent for document\nconversations and chan"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ge review, or the CLI for automation. All three connect to\nthe Workspace Server, which owns document"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" storage and permissions. Agents work in\nisolated Worktrees, verify their changes, and hand the resu"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"lt to a person for\nreview. Humans can continue editing and stay in control of what gets merged."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Why Univer Workspace"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| For people                                                                          | For agents  "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"                                                      | For operators                               "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"                         |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Organize content in Personal and Team Spaces                                        | Create and e"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"dit rich Office content through the Univer Facade API | Deploy one Browser and Server application   "},{"id":"p10s3","text":"                         |\n| Co-edit Sheets, Docs, Slides, Bases, and Boards                        "},{"id":"p10s4","text":"             | Inspect data, render screenshots/PDFs, and run layout checks      | Keep product, col"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"laboration, and Blob data under application control |\n| Share content with role- and node-aware acce"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"ss control, including anonymous viewing | Discover version-matched Skills and APIs offline          "},{"id":"p10s7","text":"        | Integrate password, GitHub, Discord, or application OAuth login      |\n| Use Recent, Trash"},{"id":"p10s8","text":", file import/export, and review views                             | Work through multiple rounds wi"},{"id":"p10s9","text":"thout changing trunk               | Operate a documented HTTP API with explicit recovery boundaries"},{"id":"p10s10","text":"hanging trunk               | Operate a documented HTTP API with explicit recovery boundaries      |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Spreadsheet-based mini-apps · Watch the demo"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- Agents can generate spreadsheet-based mini-apps, such as decision-making dashboards, interactive r"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"eports, and business dashboards.\n- Metrics, charts, and controls on the web page are bound to cells,"},{"id":"p12s3","text":" supporting data reads, writes, and collaborative updates."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Choose your entry point"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Entry point           | Use it for                                                                "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"                                         | Get started                                              "},{"id":"p14s3","text":"                        | Get started                                                              |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| **Workspace Browser** | Edit documents directly, collaborate, organize Spaces, and review changes "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"                                         | Start Workspace                                          "},{"id":"p15s3","text":"|\n| **Workspace Agent**   | Chat with an agent beside your documents, reference local or remote file"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"s and folders, and review Worktree changes | Install and use Agent |\n| **Workspace CLI**     | Autom"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"ate document tasks from a terminal, scripts, or an existing agent environment                       "},{"id":"p15s6","text":"          | CLI installation and usage                         |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Workspace Agent is a local web application built on DSH (DeepSeek Harness). Its\nlocal file reference"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"s point to the machine running Agent; Workspace documents\nremain on the connected service. Both Agen"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"t and CLI can connect to your existing\nWorkspace deployment or one you start locally."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The Browser is the direct editing and collaboration surface. Workspace Agent\ncombines a conversation"},{"id":"p19s2","text":" with document previews and Worktree review. The CLI gives\nagents a structured way to load, understa"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"nd, edit, validate, and render the same\ncontent. The Server resolves authoritative identity and perm"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"issions, owns\nWorkspace product workflows, and composes the Univer Collaboration SDK."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Worktree turns agent editing into an explicit review workflow:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Intermediate changes remain isolated from shared content until a person accepts\nthem. See the CLI gu"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ide for the complete product workflow."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Requirements"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- Node.js 24 or newer\n- pnpm 11"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Install dependencies and prepare the application configuration:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Start the Server:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"In another terminal, start the Browser development server:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Open <http://127.0.0.1:5173>. Vite provides hot module replacement and proxies API\nand WebSocket tra"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"ffic to the Server at <http://127.0.0.1:3020>."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"The Server can also serve the latest built Browser from port 3020 when\n`apps/workspace/dist/public` "},{"id":"p32s2","text":"exists. Its product API is available at\n<http://127.0.0.1:3020/api-docs> and\n<http://127.0.0.1:3020/"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"oduct API is available at\n<http://127.0.0.1:3020/api-docs> and\n<http://127.0.0.1:3020/openapi.yaml>."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Configuration, authentication, storage, Docker, and database migration details live\nin the Workspace"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"entication, storage, Docker, and database migration details live\nin the Workspace application guide."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Architecture principles"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"- **One authoritative Server.** Client-provided users, roles, Resources, Units,\nWorktrees, and revis"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"ions are never trusted as authority.\n- **Separate storage boundaries.** Product data, collaboration "},{"id":"p35s3","text":"state, and Blob bytes\nhave distinct owners and are coordinated through durable, idempotent operation"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"s.\n- **Published SDK contracts only.** The repository consumes public package exports and\nnever depe"},{"id":"p35s5","text":"nds on adjacent source checkouts.\n- **One exact SDK baseline.** Version-coupled `@univer-cli/*`, `@u"},{"id":"p35s6","text":"niverjs/*`, and\n`@univerjs-pro/*` packages always move together.\n- **Contract-first HTTP.** OpenAPI "},{"id":"p35s7","text":"source, generated types, Server routes, Browser, and\nCLI must describe the same behavior."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Read the technical architecture,\napplication design, and\ndata model before changing these boundaries"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"ead the technical architecture,\napplication design, and\ndata model before changing these boundaries."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
